ePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 01:35:33 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/eye-scans-detect-signs-of-atrial-fibrillation-years-before-diagnosis</guid></item><item><title>研究人员对蛋白质限制如何促进健康衰老和长寿提出了新观点</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/researchers-offer-new-perspective-on-how-protein-restriction-may-promote-healthy-aging-and-longevity</link><description>路易斯安那州立大学彭宁顿生物医学研究中心的一个新视角提出了一种新的方法来理解饮食蛋白质限制如何促进健康衰老和延长寿命：通过将细胞营养感应与激素、大脑和全身变化联系起来的协调生理反应。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/researchers-offer-new-perspective-on-how-protein-restriction-may-promote-healthy-aging-and-longevity2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 01:20:33 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/researchers-offer-new-perspective-on-how-protein-restriction-may-promote-healthy-aging-and-longevity</guid></item><item><title>疾病末期 MPS IIIA 小鼠缺乏严重的肠道表型</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/lack-of-severe-enteric-phenotypes-in-disease-endstage-mps-iiia-mice</link><description>比得哥什科技大学动物育种和生物学学院动物生物技术和遗传学系，波兰比得哥什。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/lack-of-severe-enteric-phenotypes-in-disease-endstage-mps-iiia-mice.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 01:05:33 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/lack-of-severe-enteric-phenotypes-in-disease-endstage-mps-iiia-mice</guid></item><item><title>Palladyne AI 的 Embodied AI 收入刚刚迎来收获期</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/palladyne-ais-embodied-ai-revenue-just-hit-harvest-time</link><description>63% 的收入飞跃证明机器嵌入式 AI 收入的表现优于标准的云托管工业软件模型。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/palladyne-ais-embodied-ai-revenue-just-hit-harvest-time.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 00:50:33 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/palladyne-ais-embodied-ai-revenue-just-hit-harvest-time</guid></item><item><title>技术是“如何”，而不是“为什么”或“什么”</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/technology-is-the-how-not-the-why-or-what</link><description>&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/technology-is-the-how-not-the-why-or-what.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 00:35:33 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/technology-is-the-how-not-the-why-or-what</guid></item><item><title>膀胱癌的病毒方面：BK 多瘤病毒、HPV 和尿路上皮癌</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/the-viral-side-of-bladder-cancer-bk-polyomavirus-hpv-and-urothelial-carcinoma</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 15:50:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/the-viral-side-of-bladder-cancer-bk-polyomavirus-hpv-and-urothelial-carcinoma</guid></item><item><title>前列腺癌中周期蛋白依赖性激酶抑制：过去、现在和未来</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/cyclin-dependent-kinase-inhibition-in-prostate-cancer-past-present-and-future</link><description>背景：尽管取得了重大进展，前列腺癌仍然是导致死亡的主要原因。细胞周期蛋白依赖性激酶 (CDK) 4/6 抑制剂已被批准用于治疗激素受体阳性乳腺癌，目前正在作为单一疗法和各种组合作为前列腺癌患者的潜在有价值的治疗方式进行广泛的测试。到目前为止，这些研究中发表的结果数量有限，但结果令人失望。涵盖领域：在这篇综述中，我们描述了在前列腺癌中使用 CDK4/6 抑制剂的生物学原理、描述其在前列腺癌中使用的现有临床数据，以及正在进行的 CDK4/6 抑制剂作为单一疗法和联合疗法治疗前列腺癌的临床试验。特别是，我们关注可能与前列腺癌患者特别相关的可能的耐药机制，导致从头和获得性耐药，并且我们强调可以克服这种耐药性的新策略。结论：目前的临床试验正在积极致力于完善 CDK4/6 抑制剂在前列腺癌患者中的作用；开发其他细胞周期靶标的新抑制剂，例如 CDK2 和 CDK7；并探索与其他相关途径（例如 PI3K 或 MAPK）抑制剂的新型联合疗法。晚期前列腺癌的进一步基因组亚型可能会揭示最有可能受益于细胞周期靶向药物的患者亚群。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/cyclin-dependent-kinase-inhibition-in-prostate-cancer-past-present-and-future.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 15:35:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/cyclin-dependent-kinase-inhibition-in-prostate-cancer-past-present-and-future</guid></item><item><title>太空如何为大脑打开一扇窗户</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/how-space-is-opening-a-window-into-the-brain</link><description>分享这篇文章&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/how-space-is-opening-a-window-into-the-brain2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 15:20:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/how-space-is-opening-a-window-into-the-brain</guid></item></channel></rss>